# SecOps

MODE order: ASSESS-ONLY → IMPLEMENT → AUDIT. Never skip assess for production changes.
Commands: `/sec-baslat`, `/sec-devam`, `/sec-gap-analizi`, `/sec-compliance-paket`, `/sec-arsivle`, `/sec-etik-denetim`.
IR: detect → contain → eradicate → recover → lessons; write under ASSESSMENTS/ or REPORTS/.
Detection-engineering: ATT&CK labels only for coverage; ship D3FEND-aligned detections.
IMPLEMENTATION/ holds stubs until MODE=IMPLEMENT.
Hooks: secret_scan + ethics_check fail closed on dangerous shell.
